      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "先不要把概念混在一起。原文先讲 Single Agent，再讲 Multi-Agent 的协调概念，最后讲 Agentic Workflows。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.67,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 10.32,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s03.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s03.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "Agentic Workflow 讲的是结构：任务如何排序、交接、并行和评估。它支撑架构，但不等于 Multi-Agent 的协调概念。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.758,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.408,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s04.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s04.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "Single Agent 是一个 Agent 负责目标，用工具、技能和记忆推进任务。它可以调用流程，但核心仍是一个 Agent 的动态决策。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.71,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.36,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s05.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s05.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "所以，目标清楚、路径需要动态选择，但还不需要多个专家一起处理时，先从 Single Agent 开始。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.902,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.552,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s06.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s06.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "Multi-Agent 的核心不是顺序或并行，而是协调。原文先分集中式和去中心化：集中式里才有 hierarchical pattern。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.158,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 11.808,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s07.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s07.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "但代价也很真实。PDF 提醒，Multi-Agent 可能消耗单 Agent 大约十到十五倍 Token。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.166,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.816,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s08.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s08.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "所以架构选择，主要看五件事：控制要求、领域复杂度、资源预算、上线时间，以及需不需要领域专家参与。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 13.214,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.864,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s09.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep01-architecture-choice/audio/s09.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "一旦进入真实业务系统，还要能观察和治理：提示链、模型决策、检索上下文、Token 消耗，都要看得见。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 11.606,
